Mon Nov  2 12:00:00 UTC 2026 - Lyra OS Release <rodrigo@lyraos.com.br>

- Update to upstream Zed 1.26.2.
- Pin the new release tarball by SHA-256 (matches the GitHub release
  asset digest); LICENSE-GPL and LICENSE-APACHE are unchanged.

