Mon Aug 24 15:30:00 UTC 2026 - Lyra OS Release <rodrigo@lyraos.com.br>

- Exclude the private, RPATH-loaded libraries from automatic library
  Requires as well as Provides; the bundled libffi.so.7 was otherwise
  pulled in as an unsatisfiable system dependency on hosts that ship a
  newer libffi.

-------------------------------------------------------------------
Mon Aug 24 12:00:00 UTC 2026 - Lyra OS Release <rodrigo@lyraos.com.br>

- Package upstream Zed 1.16.1 from the official Linux release tarball.
- Point the auto-updater at Zypper via ZED_UPDATE_EXPLANATION; updates are
  delivered exclusively through the signed Lyra OBS repository.
- Strip the bundled binaries and exclude the private, RPATH-loaded
  libraries from automatic library Provides.
